# Tenshodo Membership (jeuno 17): Ghebi's fame edge. A level 75 Warrior with the form (a GM), Jeuno fame level 2 ((249
# + 0 + 0) / 2 = 124): nil, her script's 106 (4); finished with option 2: the quest's 106 finish runs on her script's
# event too: Prog 1. 250 (a GM; 125, level 3): 107; a full bag: the invite not given, not completed (the form kept);
# 107 again: completed.
lists LowerJeuno/Ghebi_Damomohe/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/106 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/107
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=17,-0.1,-7.6 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Sandoria 249
keyitem TenshodoApplicationForm
login
trigger Ghebi_Damomohe                  # fame level 2: nil; her script's 106 (4)
finish option=2                         # the quest's 106 finish: Prog 1
fame Sandoria 250                       # a GM
trigger Ghebi_Damomohe                  # fame level 3, the form: 107
fill-inventory
finish                                  # the invite cannot be given: not completed; the form kept
free-inventory
trigger Ghebi_Damomohe                  # 107
finish                                  # completed; the form taken
